// "I'm Just Supporting a Friend" (id "tup"; script v4, 2026-10-22, docs/x05-supporting-a-friend.md): Denise says yes to a friend's party, Rhonda says the party is a store and tells how Tupperware went from the shelves to home parties (Detroit 1949, sold in 1958), then the 2018 survey of people who sell this stuff.
// Format: see scripts/voice-gen.mjs (lines, directions) and scripts/voice-build.py (cast, plan, gaps, lead, tableSfx). The order of "lines" is the story's order; the numbers are the story's order too.
